WEBVTT

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.270
It seems that he fell from the train platform.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.650
Isn't that actually a suicide?

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.490
Sawamura...

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.370
is dead.

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:25.500
Am I really...

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.130
unable to escape from my fate?

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.470
Keita-kun!

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.310
Keita-san!

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.940
"Reunion"

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.310
Where am I?

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.850
We are in Kuraki-san's cottage.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.310
Kuraki?

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:51.530
The person you saw before you collapsed outside the cave.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.820
How are you feeling, Ibuki?

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.200
S-Sawamura?!

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:00.450
Keita-kun!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.830
Are you really Sawamura?

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.250
The Sawamura you knew died back then.

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:12.590
I am now Kuraki Daichi and I'm working as a a direct subordinate of Shishigami Reishin.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.840
Ibuki, I want to help you.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.810
I know that you're a Sub.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:27.980
I also know that you've formed a contract with the Mototsumitama here.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:30.610
You collapsed because you had little Tera left.

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:35.860
Death awaits if you don't take actions against it.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:40.370
Ibuki, cooperate with me.

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:44.120
Cooperate with the Shishigami clan?

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.120
Please don't ask for the impossible.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.250
Keita-san won't cooperate with-

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.290
I didn't say that he was going to cooperate with the Shishigami clan.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.630
I said that I wanted him to cooperate with me.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.640
I intend to rebel against Reishin.

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:02.470
That's why, Ibuki-

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.100
W-Wait!

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:08.060
The mere fact that you're still alive is already confusing enough...

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:11.650
I see. Sorry.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:17.030
I always thought that you were dead.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:23.530
Back then, I felt that it would have been great if I had the chance to explain everything to you.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:26.500
When I was still Sawamura,

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:31.540
I discovered the existence of the Doppeliner system and the Mototsumitama.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.420
After that...

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.050
I got to know Reishin.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:42.300
Reishin had a good opinion of me and appointed me to work under him.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:46.060
The thing is, it would have caused confusion if I had suddenly disappeared.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.430
Just as we were thinking of a way to handle that...

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.490
My Sub, a kid named Kuraki, died.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.200
Was he killed by someone?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.120
I don't know the truth.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.740
And so, he was buried as Sawamura,

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.620
while I assumed the name of Kuraki and worked as Reishin's subordinate.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:15.250
This was all thanks to you, Ibuki.

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.210
Thanks to me?

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.220
It was because you told me how your mother died.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:28.180
Because of that, I began to do a lot of investigating

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.980
and I discovered the existence of the Doppeliner system.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:34.230
As a result, I was able to successfully become a part of the core of the Shishigami clan.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:38.230
I believed that by doing so, I would be able to create a more beautiful world.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.740
Sawamura...

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:44.110
But the truth was the complete opposite.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:51.910
It appears to me that Reishin is only concerned about how he can make use of humans and the Doppeliner system for his own sake.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.460
He arranged for numerous people to meet their Subs and as a result, many died.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.590
All in order to create Master Roots...

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:07.300
Reishin just wanted to create a new world that favors the Mototsumitama.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:14.980
Ibuki, I feel that the Doppeliner system should be governed by humans.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:20.320
I want to use that system to create an ideal world.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.200
That's unacceptable!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.700
The Doppeliner system isn't something that should be used or governed!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.620
But Reishin is making use of it.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.620
But...

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.790
The fates of humans are being manipulated by that system.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:41.800
Why are Mototsumitama, who aren't related to it, allowed to do whatever they want to the system?

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.130
We shall no longer be toyed around with by fate.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.640
It's time for humans to make use of fate.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.110
Ah, Onii-chan!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.480
Good morning!

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.610
Late again?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.630
Hey, Ibuki!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.880
You barely made it on time.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.050
Take a look!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.380
I improved my fastest course time record!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.550
Wow, Minato Ward's Alonso!

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.880
I thought I was more like Raikkonen.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.590
Who's that?

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:30.850
You don't know him?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:31.760
Don't I look like him?

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.140
In which way?

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.520
You don't look like him.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.520
Amazing.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:41.020
Sawamura-kun, you got the high score on the final exam again.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.280
Can you leave me alone?

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.150
We won't disturb your reading.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.530
Treat us as if we're invisible.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.750
Sawamura-kun...?

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.540
Teacher.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.090
You wrote the wrong formula there.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.630
As expected from you, Sawamura.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.050
You noticed.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.300
Please don't make excuses for your own mistakes.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.020
He pisses me off.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.810
Hey, Sawamura. It seems that Sasaki is interested in you.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.190
You're quite popular.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.820
So <i>that's</i> what you're good at studying?

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.820
How pointless.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.160
That's why you are so ignorant.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.660
What are you saying?

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.040
You bastard...

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.460
What is it, Ibuki?

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.540
Acting as a sumo referee...

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.300
Start!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.050
What are you up to, sumo?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.340
That's so outdated.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.640
If you don't hurry, the fried chicken sandwich will be sold out.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.100
Whoa, really?

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.140
Ibuki, we just can't win against you.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.430
Let's go.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.730
Hypocrite.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.030
Who are you talking about?

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.200
You probably think you're doing well, but I know what's really going on.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.290
You don't open your heart up to anyone.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.000
You're the same as I am.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:29.460
Eh? I was really looking forward to going to the karaoke with you.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.840
Sorry, something urgent popped up.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.180
You must come along next time.

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:36.260
Yeah, definitely.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.400
The book you're reading seems complicated.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.070
Do you have something to say to me?

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.990
Am I wasting your time?

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.790
It isn't wasted if I'm talking to you.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:07.290
Why don't you want to associate with the others from our class?

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.960
They are ignorant and haughty.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.510
They don't think about what kind of future they want,

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.680
and thus, are unable to put in any effort toward it.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.510
It's pointless to associate with people like them.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.060
Isn't that how you feel too?

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.140
Nope, my situation is different.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.060
Sawamura, just what kind of future do you want?

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.690
The ability to create a better world.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.280
You're weird.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.570
Well then, why are you avoiding the people from our class?

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.660
Because I'm scared.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:43.960
Scared of people?

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.370
Scared of fate.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.330
Fate?

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.670
The people I treasure will die.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:53.340
That's the kind of fate I have.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:01.770
I see.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.350
So you're running away from that fate.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.110
The parents I have aren't my real ones.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:15.610
The conditions I grew up in were terrible.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:18.070
I cursed at my own fate.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.080
That's why I want to change it.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:27.330
I worked hard, believing that my abilities would be recognized and that I would be given a chance to use them.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.170
I encountered my foster parents after that.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:35.170
They want me to succeed the company they created.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:39.010
And so, they are thinking about how to give me the best education possible.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.180
You're amazing.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:44.930
You're supposed to go against fate, Ibuki.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.770
Not only will I go against it, I'll try to make use of it, too.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:53.530
That's why I won't die, even if I become friends with you.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:03.790
I thought that I couldn't escape from my fate once I knew about your death.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:08.080
But I'm alive and you've changed.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:11.710
You didn't run away from your fate as a Sub and instead chose to continue fighting.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.130
I've always been observing you.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:18.720
That's why I want you to cooperate with me.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.760
By doing so, we are able to help you too.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.470
Help?

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:26.390
If we are able to discover and track down the whereabouts of your Root and the other Sub,

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:31.480
we will be able to prevent you from dying due to an accidental meeting.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.730
I'm able to do that now.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.490
Find my Sub?

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.490
Keita-kun!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.540
Keita-san!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.750
I won't force you to reply now.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.670
Think this through after you have had a good rest.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.590
Keita-kun, are you okay?

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:14.730
Ibuki, it's now time for me to save you.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:21.400
I'm sorry for saying something horrible just now.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:22.950
It's okay.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:27.580
Erm... Where's my Brother... Reishin?

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.910
What do you intend to do once you find out?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:31.920
I'll defeat him.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:37.420
He was the one who started disrupting the balance of Tera, right?

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.920
He's the one who wants to destroy the Reiseki too.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:44.050
Yes, but I'll try to stop him.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.930
The path toward the Reiseki will be exposed soon.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.440
Your brother, Reishin, will probably show up there, right?

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.700
Keita-kun!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.200
Akane-san?

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.950
Where's Kuro?

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:11.540
She went to talk to Kuraki-san.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:14.710
You shouldn't get up!

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:17.380
I'm okay already.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.260
See? I said that you shouldn't get up!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.970
You're still weak... What will I do if you die?!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.050
Akane-san...

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.680
I'm always waiting for you to return.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:38.980
While waiting, I'm scared and worried about whether you'll get hurt or not.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:43.490
I've always been observing you.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:52.000
You always seemed to be running away from everything, ever since Aunt Maki passed away.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:57.000
But you've definitely changed since you met Kuro-chan.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:02.460
I didn't say anything, but that change made me happy.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:06.010
I don't want a world where you no longer exist.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:08.970
I want to be always by your side.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.640
I wish to be by your side!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:18.940
That's why... please...

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.650
Sorry for always making you worried.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.740
Don't apologize. Just stay by my side!

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:37.170
Akane-san, thanks.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.540
But I have to go...

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.420
Keita-kun!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.050
Because I don't feel like running away now.

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:54.390
Proceed according to the schedule.

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.480
Sawamura, where's Kuro?

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.730
She has left.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:02.940
She has asked you to wait here.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.360
She...

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:11.570
Keita-san, thanks for what you've done so far.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.080
I will do the rest by myself.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:15.790
Sis!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.830
Thank goodness I ran into you.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.840
Please, let's search for Kakuma together.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.090
Okay, let's hurry.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:26.840
My brother has already arrived here.

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.760
Are you ready?

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.610
Makana?

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.820
Kakuma... is dead.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.510
W-What is that?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.780
What just happened?

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:34.410
The barrier has been removed and the sacred precincts have appeared.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:48.880
Going after her?

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:53.380
Yeah. She is unable to fight properly on her own.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.720
You might die.

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:58.680
I owe my life to her.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.020
Keita-kun...

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:06.270
Sano-san, just stay here until Ibuki-kun returns.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.650
Thanks, Sawamura.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.280
Akane-san.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:29.750
Keita-kun!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.310
Akane-san...

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:58.700
Stay safe.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:04.160
I'm waiting, so you must definitely return.

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:18.300
Kakuma!

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:20.180
Kakuma!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.980
Makana, please wait here.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.280
You're going alone?

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.610
Yes.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.700
Reishin is strong, right?

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.110
Can you really fight him without your contractee?

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.990
Yes, I can.

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:42.990
I'm coming along.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.960
Another victim?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.380
Keita-san, why?

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:56.550
Because I'm your partner.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.930
But...

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.520
Come, let's go.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.030
Thank you, Keita-san!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.700
Say that after we've protected the Reiseki.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.030
Come, let's hurry.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.740
Okay!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.830
I'm going off.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.790
Sano-san, please stay here.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.090
This is the safest place for you to be.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.840
Safest?

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:40.380
Because you're a Sub.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:49.600
You're the Sub of Kaionji Group's CEO, Kaionji Yuki.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.190
I'm a...

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:55.070
If one of her subordinates discover you, they will take you away...

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.610
And kill you.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.070
Impossible...

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:02.200
So please be very careful

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.620
and please don't leave the cottage.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.260
Is Yuki-sama around?

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:23.430
The Reiseki... is on this island.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.540
The world shall be led to destruction through my hands.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.590
Get away from the Reiseki!

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:06.640
It's been a while, Kuro.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:08.850
Brother...

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:12.640
That man is Kuro's...

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:19.230
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:37.380
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:37.380
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:48.800
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:48.800
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:49.140 --> 00:21:01.190
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:49.140 --> 00:21:01.190
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:17.580
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:17.580
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.170
Is Yuki-sama around?

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:27.970
"Fierce Battle"

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:28.970
I've finally found... your Root.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.730
My... Root...
